2. Interpret the argument: a GitHub URL → Branch A with Steps A1–A3 skipped; a `PLAN_NAME` (slug / numeric prefix / filename, matched against `metds/plans/*_plan.md`) → that plan drives the run; none → use the root plan (single-digit prefix `[0-9]_*_plan.md`; if several, ask which via `star_questionnaire`).
