- **The partition is automatic; no approval is asked for it.** Running this command is the request for these passes — Step 3 is where this skill collects, whether the user typed its name or the agent picked it up on a plainly matching task (conventions §10.2). Collection goes to `star_subagent` dispatches (`agent: "star-collector"`), one per pass in the order the partition sets, with no question to ask about a partition running this command already requested. The involve level moves nothing either: at `high` the partition is announced before the passes start, never put to a question (conventions §6.8).
