**First, check whether this plan has already been decomposed.** The digest carries every plan's `parent:`; find the files whose `parent:` is the target — equivalently, its prefix plus one digit. If any exist, decomposition is already partial or complete, and Steps 2–4 would overwrite files that may carry hand edits, a `## Revision History`, or execution state. Report what was found (prefix, slug, `exec_status`, and whether the parent's `## Sub-plans` / `children:` already list them) and offer via `star_questionnaire`:
