### star-plan-decomposer/references/decomposition_axes.md
--- 1
An axis is *how* you slice the parent plan into sub-plans. Pick one (mixing is allowed but confirm it). Offer the axes via `star_questionnaire`, recommendation first. Read the parent plan in full, plus the root's §3 (method), §4 (experiments), and §6 (milestones) — the sections the axes below slice; the parent scopes which part of them this level covers.
