List the prior runs the survey found — path, date, what it appears to have produced, any metric visible in its logs. Ask once via `star_questionnaire` over the numbered list which to record — more than four runs cannot be options (conventions §7.3), so offer *record all* / *record some (say the numbers)* / *record none*. Symlink each chosen run to `wkdrs/<run>/` and write a minimal `EXEC_LOG.md` from `assets/exec_log_reconstructed.md` — a reconstructed header (Principle 4), the command where recoverable, the artifacts present, and explicitly no step table. The rest stay in the inventory as evidence only, and the report says how many were left out.
