4. **Read.** The deep and abstract tiers are read as Step 3 reads — one paper at a time, requests serialized against the per-host budget in `references/source_policy.md`, one `raw/` prefix per paper — each filling the survey collector format in `references/refs_rubric.md`. A paper whose fetched page names an official repository gets the same main-agent GitHub call as Step 3, completing its score — deep tier as a rule, an abstract-tier paper only when its page was fetched anyway; no page is fetched just to find a repo. No figure is captured here: figures are Step 3's, belonging to a note this mode does not write.
